                    <div class="flex items-center justify-between font-bold text-amber-300 cursor-pointer">
                      <span>Tier 1: Guiding Cognitive Nudge</span>
                      <i data-lucide="chevron-down" class="w-3.5 h-3.5"></i>
                    </div>
                    <p class="text-slate-300 mt-1.5 leading-relaxed">
                      "Remember: the amount of R11,500 already includes VAT. Does this mean it represents 100% or 115% of the selling price?"
                    </p>
                  </div>
                  <!-- Tier 2 -->
                  <div class="p-3 rounded-xl bg-white/5 border border-white/10">
                    <div class="flex items-center justify-between font-bold text-blue-300 cursor-pointer">
                      <span>Tier 2: Statutory Formula Rule</span>
                      <i data-lucide="chevron-down" class="w-3.5 h-3.5"></i>
                    </div>
                    <p class="text-slate-300 mt-1.5 leading-relaxed font-mono">
                      VAT Exclusive Base = Gross × (100 / 115)<br/>
                      Output VAT = Gross × (15 / 115)
                    </p>
                  </div>
                  <!-- Tier 3 -->
                  <div class="p-3 rounded-xl bg-emerald-500/10 border border-emerald-500/30">
                    <div class="flex items-center justify-between font-bold text-emerald-300 cursor-pointer">
                      <span>Tier 3: Stepwise Worked Derivation</span>
                      <i data-lucide="check" class="w-3.5 h-3.5"></i>
                    </div>
                    <p class="text-slate-300 mt-1.5 leading-relaxed">
                      R11,500 × (15 / 115) = R1,500. Then Net Sales = R11,500 - R1,500 = R10,000. Full method marks awarded for both lines!
                    </p>
